diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 21762ee4cd8463f5b02d247a3b78e715ad5e2905..9813c68eda2b07206b0790f40b022b9568a2bd8e 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -31,4 +31,18 @@ from midnight to midnight; the same item cannot be booked twice for overlapping
 `book` throw for an unknown item or a disallowed period, and `book` also throws when the item is
 already booked for part of the period.
 
+To see what can still be rented, ask for availability:
+
+```ts
+const freeBoards = desk.availability({
+  start: '2024-06-01T00:00:00.000Z',
+  end: '2024-06-03T00:00:00.000Z',
+  kind: 'board',
+});
+// => ['board-1', 'board-3']
+```
+
+`availability` returns the sorted ids of the equipment that is free for the whole period, restricted
+to `kind` when given, or of any kind otherwise. It throws for a disallowed period or an invalid kind.
+
 Cancellation is not implemented yet.
